          {
            "title": "Example: Import from library",
            "id": 124677,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Programımızın beklemesini sağlamak için <code>time</code> kütüphanesindeki <code>sleep</code> modülüne ihtiyacımız var. <strong>Yalnızca</strong> bu modülü içe aktaran kodu yaz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"from\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" time \" /><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sleep\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;This message is shown immediately.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sleep(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;This message is shown after a 1-second delay.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"as\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"install\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"This message is shown immediately.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"This message is shown after a 1-second delay.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>from</code>, ardından <code>time</code> ve sonra <code>import</code>, <code>sleep</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
